    "updated_at": "2025-10-31T18:16:37Z",
    "body": "If we already have it for the video element, I suppose that makes sense. Does the video element ever not add controls when the controls attribute is set on it though? Since I imagine there will be many situations where the img element does not actually show any controls when the controls attribute is set on it - or do you think it should show a fullscreen button everywhere?",
