    "created_at": "2025-10-31T20:15:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-10-31T20:15:30Z",
    "body": "@josepharhar For the purpose of this specific issue, the user agent should **not** just show a fullscreen button everywhere, since allowing the UA determine whether or not it should be presented is one of the main goals of this proposal. The spec for media elements says that the user agent _should_ show controls if the attribute is present; I imagine this is one way the specs would slightly differ.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
