    "body": "The other types of controls could certainly show, tho - I *really* like the idea of showing an ALT badge in the corner (for images large enough that it's not disruptive, and with heuristically-determined \"adequate\" alt text, not just an empty string or a filename, etc). Those could show all the time (and potentially be controllable via browser settings).",
