    "created_at": "2026-01-29T17:17:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-29T17:17:02Z",
    "body": "The alt idea is nice, but if I want to enable this spatial use-case for spatial users, as an enhancement, but I don't want to add clutter to my image display for other users, what can I do?\n\nI guess something like https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/6715 might allow this, but WebKit oppose.",
