    "created_at": "2026-01-30T12:49:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-30T12:49:39Z",
    "body": "I think if you want to be in full control of the UI you'll have to do something imperative. That's always been the design philosophy around the `controls` attribute.\n\nThere might be a middle ground somewhere in-between, but as the discussion in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2293 shows (of which \"but WebKit oppose\" seems an unfair summary) this requires a fairly nuanced solution and it's not entirely clear as-of-yet that designing one is worth doing.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
