    "created_at": "2026-01-30T15:01:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-30T15:01:25Z",
    "body": "> \"but WebKit oppose\" seems an unfair summary\n\nAh, I didn't mean to misrepresent. I saw comments about `controlslist` [like this one](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2293#issuecomment-283698523):\n\n> Not only will WebKit refuse to implement this, we will vigorously object to it being added to the spec. It is specifically user-hostile, and has no articulable use case.\n\n…and thought it was off the table.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
