    "updated_at": "2026-02-09T15:28:55Z",
    "body": "I suspect that we'd be okay with hints, but definitely not read-back or a requirement that the hints be honored. I do think that overall `controls` for media elements has been useful and I hope that on that basis we can at least agree to extend it to `img` elements as well.",
