    "created_at": "2026-02-12T10:24:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-12T10:24:12Z",
    "body": "I think browsers shouldn't provide an \"alt\" badge. It might lead to more incorrect use of `alt` as people think it's for a caption that can be shown on demand. It would also be inconsistent with other feature that have fallback content (e.g., canvas, object).\n\nIs there interest to support any other controls for `img`, like a play/pause button for animated images?",
