    "updated_at": "2026-03-04T05:10:53Z",
    "body": "Thanks for your reply! That’s just one of the possibilities of this attribute and presumably we’d start offering that on top of the proposed CSS functionality which would allow for control outside of the UI. I think once CSS is further along we should stipulate that in the specification.",
